  "body": "Scoped independent triage of W09\u2019s W10 review at `c9a96da71a1977014680e5a92e600dfc7e3874db` confirms component-assertion corrections, with a split outcome rather than applying UNKNOWN to every target. Preserve original findings `W09-W10-SKEPTIC-DIFCO-COMPONENT-METHOD` and `W09-W10-SKEPTIC-COMPONENT-CLOSURE` and their source bindings.\n\n- Four HCl proposals (`sv3-hm-concentrated_hcl_nbrc_togo_source_reagent`, `sv3-hm-hcl_nominal25percent_jcm431_899`, `sv3-hm-hcl_nominal32percent_jcm770`, `sv3-hm-hcl_nominal35percent_togo_m3216`): change `component_assertion.completeness` from PARTIAL to UNKNOWN. Their cited receiving recipes name and dose the acid inputs but do not establish their complete reagent recipes or explicitly document omitted constituents. Retain the one named UNMAPPED HCl part, literal strengths, unspecified percent basis/carrier and source-overlap holds. Separately listed receiving-stock water must not become an acid-reagent component.\n- `sv3-hm-difco-columbia1270` (`b9b6d6679fdafd46c3400f9fec807ad71b17494adcce181d0fb464a0ea08f18c`): change LABEL_ENUMERATION to CURATED_INTERPRETATION for the current names-only derivation. The product label does not enumerate its seven parts. Recommend COMPLETE **only for all seven immediate ingredient names in the explicitly declared nominal2009 manufacturer formula**, with that scope made unambiguous in assertion notes.\n\nThe genuine [BD2009 manual](https://fsl.nmsu.edu/documents/difcobblmanual_2nded_lowres.pdf), printed158/PDF170, gives the full seven-input nominal Difco formula and the44g preparation direction; exactPDF SHA256 `e5e836a75f13283d477467b20ffc0d332531e0f3a0effb5d64a7147a6985c0b7` was inspected including the table layout and performance-adjustment footnote. [JCM1270](https://www.jcm.riken.jp/cgi-bin/jcm/jcm_grmd?GRMD=1270) separately names44g BD-Difco base, water and sheep blood. Unknown historical lot, possible performance adjustment and absent quantitative component ratios do not make the **nominal source-list** incomplete. Keep those unknowns explicit; do not claim all molecular contents, dry mass fractions, exact JCM lot composition or BBL/EH equivalence. If the author deliberately chooses an actual historical-lot assertion instead of the existing nominal-list scope, UNKNOWN is the alternative and must be explained, not silently substituted.\n\nPreserve all component objects, quantities, identities, source cases, original evidence and full history; append truthful correction events and independently re-review exact successor bytes. This is source-relative assertion curation, not a human-only MappingEvidence issue, a new identity hold, a mixed-Columbia owner partition or a release approval.\n\nTriage packet: `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/preflight/w10-family-residual-triage-v1/`, HANDOFF SHA256 `0e9eb39e24a259ecdfd1ad0c405b6aac7a38dcb3aca99f72d557452a5c57ce88`; manifest `271b343e5c7a9174286c1706e5438b858d931f28c8abc6021fc5bff682631989` (63 files rehashed by coordinator). Thirteen primary bodies and the BD table layout were inspected. Native private review validates; the five original payloads pass schema. No owner has changed.\n"
